{"id":"n72123-1-12","stage":1,"title":"초 · 初","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72123-1-12-1","ko":"요즘 신혼 생활은 어떠세요?","zh":"最近的新婚生活怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신혼","meaning":"新婚","explanation":"신혼：新婚","readings":[{"term":"신혼","audio":"/audio/7b25786f569caa8e8e2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65654","senseId":"1","lemma":"신혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활은","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"4","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"7b25786f569caa8e","term":"신혼","zh":"新婚","audio":"/audio/7b25786f569caa8e8e2d.mp3","entryId":"65654","definition":"刚结婚；或新结婚。","pronunciation":["신혼"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"做某事或某个活动度日；或指那样的状态。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6edb17218e3366f2d03.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72123-1-12-2","ko":"아직 결혼 초라 서투른 게 많지만 남편이 잘해 줘요.","zh":"因为刚结婚，还有很多不熟练的地方，不过丈夫对我很好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"초라","meaning":"初","explanation":"초：初；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"초","audio":"/audio/1fd639e1ec96a7eafc7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72123","senseId":"1","lemma":"초","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서투른","meaning":"生疏，笨拙","explanation":"서투르다：生疏，笨拙；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"서투르다","audio":"/audio/99f15241a42214b2a477.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29043","senseId":"1","lemma":"서투르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많지만","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남편이","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘해","meaning":"善待","explanation":"잘하다：善待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"da38b2d66ddadc4c","term":"결혼","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3","entryId":"31665","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼"]},{"id":"1fd639e1ec96a7ea","term":"초","zh":"初","audio":"/audio/1fd639e1ec96a7eafc7f.mp3","entryId":"72123","definition":"一段期间的开始或初期。","pronunciation":["초"]},{"id":"99f15241a42214b2","term":"서투르다","zh":"生疏，笨拙","audio":"/audio/99f15241a42214b2a477.mp3","entryId":"29043","definition":"对某事不熟练或不擅长。","pronunciation":["서ː투르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善待","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"亲切、用心地对待。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/748ee4b3b1131ece68df.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.897,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72123","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecomm